rise Support, you get 24x7 technical support from high-quality engineers, t=
ools and technology to automatically manage the health of your environment,=
 consultative review and guidance based on your applications, and a designa=
ted Technical Account Manager (TAM) to coordinate access to proactive/preve=
ntative programs and AWS subject matter experts. This plan supports archite=
ctural guidance contextual to your application.</p>

<p><strong>AWS Enterprise On-Ramp Support</strong> - You should use the AWS=
 Enterprise On-Ramp Support plan if you have production/business critical w=
orkloads in AWS and want 24x7 access to technical support and need expert g=
uidance to grow and optimize in the Cloud. This plan supports architectural=
 guidance contextual to your application (one per year).</p>

